# Freetime Broker — publish only the product.
#
# This project was built inside the course companion folder, so the repo root
# also holds coursework and kit docs that must NOT be public. This file works
# as a whitelist: ignore everything, then re-include the four things that ship.
# Anything new added at the root stays private unless it is listed here.

# 1. Ignore everything at the repo root.
/*

# 2. Re-include only the product.
!/README.md
!/index.html
!/data/
!/policies/
!/design/

# 3. Keep this file itself tracked.
!/.gitignore

# 4. Never ship OS or editor junk, even from inside the folders above.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
